<launch>

  <!-- Self-contained RTSP demo.

       Streams a GStreamer test pattern over RTSP with no camera and no ROS Image
       publisher required, so you can verify an install end-to-end in one command:

         roslaunch ros_rtsp example.launch

       Then connect a client (see README) to:
         rtsp://127.0.0.1:8554/test    (moving ball)
         rtsp://127.0.0.1:8554/clock   (SMPTE bars + clock overlay, for latency)

       It simply reuses the built-in launch file with the example configuration. -->

  <include file="$(find ros_rtsp)/launch/rtsp_streams.launch">
    <arg name="config" value="$(find ros_rtsp)/config/example_stream_setup.yaml" />
  </include>

</launch>
